/target
target
results/

# What a run leaves in the checkout. A report describes one machine at one moment and is
# regenerated, never committed: `-o` and `--output-csv` write wherever they are pointed, and
# the default is right here.
*.json
*.csv
*.log
nohup.out
core.*
perf.data*

# Media. This tool reads an image for the vision suite and writes none, so anything matching
# here arrived by accident — a downloaded fixture, a paste, a stray capture. Ignoring it costs
# nothing and is what keeps a repository from shipping content it never meant to redistribute.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.ogg
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mid
*.midi

# Editor and tooling state.
*~
*.swp
*.swo
